  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39659824",
      "title": "Outsourcing Data Into A Separate File",
      "sourceHash": "19257efe42d7903e5b8728b028f6480b5f4aa438d40ff11dbbecdf8cfa27dc3b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.93,
          "end": 3.27,
          "en": "So now that the buttons work correctly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.27,
          "end": 7.8,
          "en": "it's finally time to check for whether a player won.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.8,
          "end": 9.24,
          "en": "For example, here, the player",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.24,
          "end": 11.97,
          "en": "with the symbol O would've won.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.97,
          "end": 14.73,
          "en": "And as so often there will be different ways",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.73,
          "end": 17.4,
          "en": "of determining whether a player won.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.4,
          "end": 18.96,
          "en": "But one way to find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.96,
          "end": 21.48,
          "en": "whether a player won is to simply check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.48,
          "end": 25.02,
          "en": "for all possible winning combinations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.02,
          "end": 26.94,
          "en": "that you could achieve here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.94,
          "end": 30.39,
          "en": "and see if any of those combinations is met.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.39,
          "end": 34.02,
          "en": "And we wanna do that on every turn, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.02,
          "end": 36.72,
          "en": "because every turn the game could be over.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.72,
          "end": 39.9,
          "en": "I guess technically not during the first couple of turns",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 39.9,
          "end": 41.73,
          "en": "but to keep things simple,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.73,
          "end": 44.163,
          "en": "we can simply check it on every turn.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.99,
          "end": 48.18,
          "en": "But where should we add our check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.18,
          "end": 50.613,
          "en": "and how should that check look like?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.84,
          "end": 55.95,
          "en": "Well, a good place is the app component again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.95,
          "end": 60.95,
          "en": "because I soon want to show some game over screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.23,
          "end": 63.75,
          "en": "on top of this game board.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.75,
          "end": 66.18,
          "en": "And therefore I need the information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.18,
          "end": 70.68,
          "en": "whether the game is over here in this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.68,
          "end": 74.25,
          "en": "Hence, I'll start by adding a little helper constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.25,
          "end": 76.68,
          "en": "outside of the component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.68,
          "end": 78.33,
          "en": "where I wanna hard code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.33,
          "end": 82.833,
          "en": "all my possible winning combinations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 83.94,
          "end": 88.92,
          "en": "And this will be an array of arrays where I describe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.92,
          "end": 92.88,
          "en": "all these different possible winning combinations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.88,
          "end": 94.89,
          "en": "So every array inside of this array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.89,
          "end": 97.44,
          "en": "is one possible combination.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.44,
          "end": 99.36,
          "en": "And every combination, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.36,
          "end": 103.41,
          "en": "consists of three different selected fields.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.41,
          "end": 104.82300000000001,
          "en": "For example, here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.08,
          "end": 109.303,
          "en": "this here would be one winning combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.303,
          "end": 112.68,
          "en": "that the first field in the first row is selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.68,
          "end": 115.53,
          "en": "and the second field in the first row, and the third field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.53,
          "end": 118.56,
          "en": "in the first row, but also the first field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.56,
          "end": 122.01,
          "en": "in the first column, the first field in the second column",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.01,
          "end": 124.353,
          "en": "and the first field in the third column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.22,
          "end": 126.72,
          "en": "So that's what I want to describe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.72,
          "end": 130.68,
          "en": "as a winning combination now, and we can do this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.68,
          "end": 133.35,
          "en": "in this array that represents",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.35,
          "end": 136.89,
          "en": "the first winning combination by adding an object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.89,
          "end": 141.243,
          "en": "as a first element in there with row zero, col zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.34,
          "end": 146.32,
          "en": "And with that I simply mean that if the first row",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.618,
          "end": 149.16,
          "en": "and the first column is selected,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.16,
          "end": 151.47,
          "en": "this field here is selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.47,
          "end": 155.13,
          "en": "because that's where the first row and column intersect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.13,
          "end": 157.863,
          "en": "So that's what row zero, col zero means.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.06,
          "end": 160.42000000000002,
          "en": "So that's the first element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.058,
          "end": 162.891,
          "en": "of this first winning combination.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.891,
          "end": 166.392,
          "en": "The next element is that we have the first row",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.392,
          "end": 169.32,
          "en": "and I'm using zero for the first row",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.32,
          "end": 173.733,
          "en": "and column because in JavaScript, indexes start at zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.69,
          "end": 177.54,
          "en": "But the next element of this first winning combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.54,
          "end": 179.19,
          "en": "is that we have the first row",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.19,
          "end": 182.133,
          "en": "but now the second column with index one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 184.08,
          "end": 188.61,
          "en": "So now it's still this row, but this column,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.61,
          "end": 193.35,
          "en": "so this element, and before we selected this element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.35,
          "end": 197.55,
          "en": "So now we already got two elements next to each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 197.55,
          "end": 199.5,
          "en": "And of course you can probably already guess",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 199.5,
          "end": 202.17000000000002,
          "en": "that the next element will be this one here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 202.17000000000002,
          "end": 204.243,
          "en": "this last element in the first row.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.64,
          "end": 208.29,
          "en": "So this one is the second element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.29,
          "end": 212.57999999999998,
          "en": "The last element is first row, but last column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 212.57999999999998,
          "end": 213.993,
          "en": "So the third column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 215.43,
          "end": 217.89,
          "en": "And now it turns out that there are a bunch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 217.89,
          "end": 221.49,
          "en": "of possible winning combinations, and therefore attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 221.49,
          "end": 226.49,
          "en": "you find a file called winning combinations.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 227.4,
          "end": 230.91,
          "en": "You find this file attached and in that file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 230.91,
          "end": 235.29,
          "en": "if you open it, you'll find this exported array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 235.29,
          "end": 238.35,
          "en": "So you can simply download that file or create it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 238.35,
          "end": 242.1,
          "en": "in your project and paste the content of that attached file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 242.1,
          "end": 245.37,
          "en": "into your winning combinations JS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 245.37,
          "end": 248.82,
          "en": "so that you got all these winning combinations here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 248.82,
          "end": 250.41,
          "en": "And with that file added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 250.41,
          "end": 252.81,
          "en": "you can go back to the app JSX file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 252.81,
          "end": 257.73,
          "en": "and there simply import winning combinations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 257.73,
          "end": 262.507,
          "en": "like this, from ./winningcombinations.JS like this.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}